COMMENT ON FUNCTION "private"."business_hours_deadline"("p_facility_id" "uuid", "p_from" timestamp with time zone, "p_minutes" integer) IS 'Walks a facility''s own opening hours forward by p_minutes. Falls back to wall-clock when no hours are configured, rather than inventing a 9-to-5.';



